{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Manor. In this RPG, you control a mage working for DEMONCORP. Now you must solve a case for a disgruntled customer... or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down hand drawn world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brain teasing puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging spell system brimming with personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulful, character-rich story with an emphasis on humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by one person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought I found a 7th dog, but it was actually just the 3rd dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you play this game, can you count the dogs for me...? I'm not good at it.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843100?t=1754036808","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843100?t=1754036808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843100/13035f3b6d155f060c2ac9baba94aec299931378/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754036808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843100/13035f3b6d155f060c2ac9baba94aec299931378/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754036808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Manor. In this RPG, you control a mage working for DEMONCORP. Now you must solve a case for a disgruntled customer... or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down hand drawn world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brain teasing puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging spell system brimming with personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulful, character-rich story with an emphasis on humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by one person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought I found a 7th dog, but it was actually just the 3rd dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you play this game, can you count the dogs for me...? I'm not good at it.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Ehab Nasir"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843100/4c22c5d99fd521d53c076903b13f0dd69efe0e41/header.jpg?t=1754036808","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3843100/663233627/5326fcfa25dc4a53af223dba99f8cd519304623b/1754009022/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754009374","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3843100/663233627/5326fcfa25dc4a53af223dba99f8cd519304623b/1754009022/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754009374","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3843100/663233627/5326fcfa25dc4a53af223dba99f8cd519304623b/1754009022/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754009374","id":257176512,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176512/movie480.mp4?t=1754009374","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176512/movie_max.mp4?t=1754009374"},"name":"The Manor","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176512/effb4a554924775a338e10d120fd70088e12b84e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754009374","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176512/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754009374","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257176512/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754009374"}}],"name":"The Manor","package_groups":[],"pc_r